    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>听众朋友们，好久不见，年更选手来了</span></p><span></span><p><span>今日与大家分享我的 FIRE（财务独立，提前退休）第一年</span></p><span></span><p><span>乙巳年，我做出了三个影响余生的决定：</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>离开职场，打破传统叙事，开启另一种人生</span><br><span>接触排列，颠覆固有认知，看清认知外的真相</span><br><span>与道同行，忏悔并超度，期望终结家族业力</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>众所周知的原因，语音版本内容会更深入，欢迎收听语音版。</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/kCA_lJjt-upvAm5X7ypsFQ" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/kCA_lJjt-upvAm5X7ypsFQ"><span>文字版本</span></a></p><span></span><blockquote><span>一、关于“消失”与时间的自由</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>二、FIRE 第一年的经济账：支出与投资</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>三、重新认识自我</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>四、家族排列：看清认知外的真相</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>五、与道同行</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>六、总结&amp;祝福</span></blockquote>]]></description>
