    <guid isPermaLink="false">64a0002c233bfbafdf686ca8</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 01 Jul 2023 10:30:01 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>各位听众朋友们，大家好，我是Abby，严格意义上这是我</span><strong><span>首期</span></strong><span>播客，过去或是将直播音频导出或是做客他人栏目，从未单独录制过播客。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这是一期单口，</span><strong><span>献给我这半年FIRE的生活</span></strong><span>。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>将分享心路历程、复盘To B和To C咨询的收获和疑惑、资产配置的调整、生活和消费的变化等等。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>不好意思，不会剪辑，手机录制一刀未剪。也没写稿子，就是想到哪说到哪。</span></p><span></span><p><span>咱们主打就是个真实、自然、陪伴，也符合我的ID「共成长」，大家可以开车、散步或者做家务时候听啊，有何感触，欢迎留言～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="118">01:58</a> 为何今年离开职场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="295">04:55</a> Abby底气为何</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="470">07:50</a> Abby心态的变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="795">13:15</a> 精神内耗及解决方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1740">29:00</a> Abby靠什么养活自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1826">30:26</a>To B咨询业务的复盘（收获和挑战）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2390">39:50</a> To C咨询业务的复盘（收获和挑战）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4140">69:00</a> 资产配置的调整和建议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4560">76:00</a> 生活和消费的变化（时间花销、生活节奏、消费变化等等）</span></p><span></span><p><span>关于Abby：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://xiaobot.net/post/468f1ffb-af6d-43a9-9d9d-68a9ac3c423c" data-url="https://xiaobot.net/post/468f1ffb-af6d-43a9-9d9d-68a9ac3c423c"><span>个人咨询/命理咨询可戳：</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>公众号/视频号：Abby与你共成长</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>即刻：</span><a href="https://okjk.co/4tqpRo" data-url="https://okjk.co/4tqpRo"><span>Abby与你共成长</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>小报童：</span><a href="https://xiaobot.net/p/abby?refer=f0fb13fa-8f5a-40c4-be0d-f9b012c0871f)" data-url="https://xiaobot.net/p/abby?refer=f0fb13fa-