    <title>参加与世隔绝的禅修是一种怎么样的体验</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/645505ad94d78eb3f72c9845</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">645505ad94d78eb3f72c9845</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 05 May 2023 13:33:31 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hi，各位听友～</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期音频来自于</span><strong><span> </span></strong><span>5月5日视频号直播，也可通过「Abby与你共成长」视频号直播回放查看，enjoy～</span></p><span></span><p><span>分享主题为参加与世隔绝的禅修是一种怎么样的体验。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Abby刚刚下山，前几日在北京朝阳寺避世禅修，上山前全然接纳，下山后心生欢喜，无欲无求。</span></p><span></span><p><span>感慨诸多，所有一切均是额外惊喜。短短几日，胃寒竟康复了70%，迫不及待想要与大家分享这段经历。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎤本次节目聊到：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="42">00:42</a>什么才是佛教徒</span></p><span></span><p><span>Abby对四法印的理解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="195">03:15</a> 禅修的目的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="340">05:40</a> 山下想不明，上山也无用。</span></p><span></span><p><span>所有一切都全然接纳，尽情体验。臣服是一种顺随生命流动，而不逆流而上的简单智慧。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="578">09:38</a> 感受是灵魂的语言</span></p><span></span><p><span>每次打坐均是观呼吸，过程中不断有思虑，会暂时把思考、逻辑、理智、评判和道理搁置一旁。只要感受它就好。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="810">13:30</a> 不要祈求，要感恩</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们走不出亲人亡故的阴影，重要原因就是内心的遗憾和无奈，总有些没做的事情，没说出口的话，突然间生死相隔，再见无期。我并不确定超度的价值，但那一刻释然了。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1220">20:20</a> 胃寒康复70%</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1340">22:20</a> 想获得他人认可是一种妄念</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a> 大道至简，一本《金刚经》足以</span></p><span></span><p><span>那几日每天一本佛学经典，集中阅读的好处就是将不少过去所学理念与佛学进行了结合</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1660">27:40</a> 独处就是生活禅</span></p><span></span><p><span>只要我们沉思自我的本性时，就已经在禅修了。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1830">30:30</a> 居住一个月会如何</span></p><span></span><p><span>你也可以在下面这些地方找到我：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://xiaobot.net/post/468f1ffb-af6d-43a9-9d9d-68a9ac3c423c" data-url="https://xiaobot.net/post/468f1ffb-af6d-43a9-9d9d-68a9ac3c423c"><span>个人咨询/命理咨询可戳：</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>公众号/视频号：Abby与你共成长</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>即刻：</span><a href="https://okjk.co/4tqpRo" data-url="https://okjk.co/4tqpRo"><span>Abby与你共成长</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>小报童：</span><a href="https://xiaobot.net/p/abby?refer=f0fb13fa-8f5a-40c4-be0d-f9b012c0871f)" data-url="https://xiaobot.net/p/abby?refer=f0fb13fa-8f5a-40c4-be0d-f9b012c0871f)"><span>Abby与你共成长</span></a></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
