    <title>从Plan A到Plan Z：如何开启人生新探索</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6425587773768bea35d0f3a1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6425587773768bea35d0f3a1</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 30 Mar 2023 09:37:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hi，各位听友～</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期音频来自于</span><strong><span> </span></strong><span>3 月 15 日视频号直播，也可通过「Abby与你共成长」视频号直播回放查看，enjoy～</span></p><span></span><p><span>分享主题为探索人生的方向，更接地气的说法就是如何搞副业。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="10">00:10</a> &nbsp;个人介绍触及的启发</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="170">02:50</a> 构建属于我们自己的产品或者说作品，就是人生探索的方向之一</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="355">05:55</a> 第二增长曲线，接地气的说法是副业，并不需要完全重启。（企业ABZ规划）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="630">10:30</a> 能力构建的软实力和优势发挥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="980">16:20</a> 精准优势拆解所运用的工具</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">18:00</a> 利他是让人幸福的事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1218">20:18</a> 对一件事情的欲望（功利心）越小，越遵循内心，顾虑就越少，执念就越少，反而越会顺其自然</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a> ikigai探索过程也是自我探寻和认知迭代的过程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">30:00</a> 互动提问：最大的副业就是理财投资</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2148">35:48</a> 互动提问：做理财投资就可以财务自由吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2340">39:00</a> 互动提问：如何构建自身的理财规划以及最适合普通人的理财投资策略为何</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2493">41:33</a> 互动提问：如何在实践过程中确保天赋走在正确的方向，以及波动中如何调整心态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2783">46:23</a>：互动提问：如何进行养老规划</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2965">49:25</a> &nbsp;互动提问：未来养老要在北京吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3060">51:00</a> 互动提问：对于理性思考者如何开启对玄学的接纳和学习</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3500">58:20</a> 互动提问：Abby是否有过所谓的人生谷底又是如何走出来的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3815">63:35</a> 互动提问：对abby影响最大的书籍是什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4275">71:15</a> 互动提问：开展副业的时机为何，对于体制内探索如何看待，如何开展副业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4540">75:40</a> 互动提问：如何确保对自己产出的内容很自信</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4738">78:58</a> 互动提问：Abby还会创业吗</span></p><span></span><p><span>你也可以在下面这些地方找到我：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://xiaobot.net/post/468f1ffb-af6d-43a9-9d9d-68a9ac3c423c" data-url="https://xiaobot.net/post/468f1ffb-af6d-43a9-9d9d-68a9ac3c423c"><span>个人咨询/命理咨询可戳：</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>公众号/视频号：Abby与你共成长</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>即刻：</span><a href="https://okjk.co/4tqpRo" data-url="https://okjk.co/4tqpRo"><span>Abby与你共成长</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>小报童：</span><a href="https://xiaobot.net/p/abby?refer=f0fb13fa-8f5a-40c4-be0d-f9b012c0871f" data-url="https://xiaobot.net/p/abby?refer=f0fb13fa-8f5a-40c4-be0d-f9b012c0871f"><span>Abby与你共成长</span></a></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
