  <item>
    <title>站在他人立场上的线上「沟通」技巧&amp;《故事》对于创作者的启发</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63fdf11cb91c17e69c7d1b3b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63fdf11cb91c17e69c7d1b3b</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 28 Feb 2023 12:18:34 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hi，各位听友好久不见～</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期音频来自于周末我在「沟通」为主题的读书会上的分享。</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>站在他人立场上的线上「沟通」</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《故事》对于创作者的启发</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><a href="https://cpwc9empsn.feishu.cn/docx/KG0hdust0oVtCixIB4Mc1Xscnxf" data-url="https://cpwc9empsn.feishu.cn/docx/KG0hdust0oVtCixIB4Mc1Xscnxf"><span>演讲文稿请戳～</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间轴：</span></strong></p><span></span><h1><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2">00:02</a> 第一部分：自我&amp;分享介绍</span></h1><span></span><p><strong><span>第二部分：站在他人立场的线上沟通</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="168">02:48</a> 第一、添加微信好友后不要沉默，主动介绍自己建立连接</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="386">06:26</a> 第二、线上沟通，将话语权交给对方</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="469">07:49</a> 第三、线上求助，懂得感恩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a> 第四、再沟通一次，无需惧怕</span></p><span></span><p><u><span>这世界上想帮助他人的人有很多，但主动求助的人并没有那么多</span></u></p><span></span><h1><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="700">11:40</a>第三部分：「故事」对于创作者的启发</span></h1><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="845">14:05</a> 故事是生活的比喻，故事是现实的载体，承载我们去追寻现实，挖掘人生真谛。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="896">14:56</a> 经历的一切都会是创作的灵感源泉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1010">16:50</a> 受众需要的不仅仅是知识</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1116">18:36</a> 先表达，不要对受众的反应做期待</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1324">22:04</a> 用故事来说服他人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1476">24:36</a> 冲突是生活的本质</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1600">26:40</a>人性是唯一不会过时的主题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1741">29:01</a> Q&amp;A</span></p><span></span><p><span>你也可以在下面这些地方找到我：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>公众号/视频号：Abby与你共成长</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>即刻：</span><a href="https://okjk.co/4tqpRo" data-url="https://okjk.co/4tqpRo"><span>Abby与你共成长</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>小报童：</span><a href="https://xiaobot.net/p/abby?refer=f0fb13fa-8f5a-40c4-be0d-f9b012c0871f" data-url="https://xiaobot.net/p/abby?refer=f0fb13fa-8f5a-40c4-be0d-f9b012c0871f"><span>Abby与你共成长</span></a></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
