  <item>
    <title>失业、亲人离世、35+焦虑「Abby的2022总结」</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63aed008e7ab859986035a70</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63aed008e7ab859986035a70</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 30 Dec 2022 11:48:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>2022年尾，Abby经历了失业、亲人离世、35+焦虑，与大家聊聊我的2022。</span></p><span></span><p><span>与其让它在时间中淡去，不如聊一聊留下些痕迹。</span></p><span></span><p><span>录制当天也是外婆离去的日子，有些情绪波动，请见谅～</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢</span><strong><span>「内在修炼」</span></strong><span>的邀请，这是一档关注自我发现、自我启迪的对话节目，帮助大家照见自我，找到自己的内在向心力。</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播</span><strong><span>Summer</span></strong><span>，10年大厂产品人，ToC、ToB、AI、创新创业均有点涉猎，也是位创作者，更是我生活中的好友。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Summer的公众号：内在向心力；小报童：向心修炼</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【时间轴】</span></strong><span>：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="127">00:02:07</a> Abby的2022关键词：体验与深度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="519">00:08:39</a> 新体验：随机、去计划、去目标感。</span></p><span></span><p><span>（彩蛋：开盲盒的约会）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="576">00:09:36</a> Summer的2022计划：体验不同</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="781">00:13:01</a> Abby的完成度打分：每年只定三个Flag。</span></p><span></span><p><span>内在探索、健康、谈恋爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="914">00:15:14</a> Abby2022年的遗憾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1250">00:20:50</a> 计划外的探索与表达</span></p><span></span><p><span>对心之所往越来越清晰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1373">00:22:53</a> 生命意义的探寻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1499">00:24:59</a> 学会去转念</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1723">00:28:43</a> Summer的完成度打分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1940">00:32:20</a> Abby为何没有35+焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2101">00:35:01</a> 每个人都是一张拼图</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2284">00:38:04</a> 对职场人的建议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2592">00:43:12</a> 对团队管理的建议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2854">00:47:34</a> 职业与人生上半场关键词</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3059">00:50:59</a> Abby的2023规划</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3303">00:55:03</a> Summer的2023规划</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Peter Bradley Adams》 - I Tell Myself</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>你也可以在下面这些地方找到我：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>公众号/视频号：</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/UAYlS0kradk7mmDoHEaUXA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/UAYlS0kradk7mmDoHEaUXA"><span>Abby与你共成长</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>即刻：Abby与你共成长</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>小报童：</span><a href="https://xiaobot.net/p/abby?refer=f0fb13fa-8f5a-40c4-be0d-f9b012c0871f" data-url="https://xiaobot.net/p/abby?refer=f0fb13fa-8f5a-40c4-be0d-f9b012c0871f"><span>Abby与你共成长</span></a></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
